The '''Experience Festival!''' (超ゲリ, ''Chō Geri'', '''Super Guerrilla''') is a group of special stages appearing during special occasions. During this event, [[:Category:XP Guerrilla Stages|XP Stages]] appear more often than normal.

==Event Information==
{{Color|#FF9900|'''● XP Festival Events!'''}}<br>
Get ready to power up your Cats to the max with the special stages Blitz XP, XP Megablitz, XP Colosseum, and Merciless XP at Legend Stages!

{{Color|#00CCFF|'''･ Blitz XP Schedule'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Mon / Wed / Fri ・・・ 7:00pm ~ 9:59pm'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Tues / Thurs ・・・ 11:00am ~ 1:59pm'''}}<br>
{{Color|#00CCFF|'''･ XP Megablitz Schedule'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Mon / Wed / Fri / Sun ・・・ 11:00am ~ 1:59pm'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Tues / Thurs / Sat ・・・ 7:00pm ~ 9:59pm'''}}<br>
{{Color|#00CCFF|'''･ XP Colosseum Schedule'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Mon / Thurs・・・ 4:00pm ~ 4:59pm'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Tues / Fri / Sun ・・・ 10:00pm ~ 10:59pm'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Wed / Sat ・・・ 8:00am ~ 8:59am'''}}<br>
{{Color|#00CCFF|'''･ Merciless XP Schedule'''}}<br>
